[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Requirements

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @program

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TVC-REQ-002
LEVEL: L1
REQUIREMENT_TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Ease of Integration
APPLICABLE_SUBSYSTEM: Airframe, Propulsion, Actuation, Recovery
SUBTEAM_OWNER: Systems, Structures, Electrical
INDIVIDUAL_OWNER: Systems Lead
VEHICLE_CONFIGURATION: TVC-F1
MISSION_PHASE: Pre-Launch
FLIGHT_ATTEMPT: All
OPEN_ITEM_STATUS: None
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Demonstration
STATUS: Draft
STATEMENT: The vehicle shall be fully integrated, launched, and recovered within 2 hours under nominal conditions.
RATIONALE: This requirement decomposes TVC-MO-004, specifically focusing on the vehicle, and giving a specific timeframe for complete turnaround. Most launch sites are open from 10 AM to 4 PM, so 2 hours is the absolute maximum each launch may take. This does not take into account failures, which are varied and more specifically specified in the Concept of Operations documents.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: TVC-MO-004
